                                        "entry_id": "a4cb5613-9c40-37a6-9b63-20526a49a8fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to principles of right and wrong in behaviour, especially for teaching right behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbafbac1-fb8a-4707-b894-1aaf84ec962f",
                                                "sense_id": "65d8bd8b-2496-3c04-8a42-369ba6318ffa",
                                                "text": "moral judgments; a moral poem"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0679d585-8baa-4369-93c9-700b4f1171a0",
                                                "sense_id": "65d8bd8b-2496-3c04-8a42-369ba6318ffa",
                                                "text": "a moral obligation"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f0e9437-f136-46f6-98e0-70f1c67f4cfe",
                                                "sense_id": "65d8bd8b-2496-3c04-8a42-369ba6318ffa",
                                                "text": "She had wandered without rule or guidance in a moral wilderness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe11e0d8-b47d-3b4e-9012-301e9f17da1e",
                                        "entry_id": "a4cb5613-9c40-37a6-9b63-20526a49a8fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conforming to a standard of right behaviour; sanctioned by or operative on one's conscience or ethical judgment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae1c3d4e-1b36-4938-828b-43c3f9f08e12",
                                                "sense_id": "fe11e0d8-b47d-3b4e-9012-301e9f17da1e",
                                                "text": "a moral action"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7bfebdc-e3e0-4c45-b6de-c7e4bfe47157",
                                                "sense_id": "fe11e0d8-b47d-3b4e-9012-301e9f17da1e",
                                                "text": "The stories did not seem to me to touch life. They were plainly intended to have a bracing moral effect, and perhaps had this result for the people at whom they were aimed. They left me with the impression of a well-delivered stereopticon lecture, with characters about as life-like as the shadows on the screen, and whisking on and off, at the mercy of the operator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfb8fb45-6b7f-3e38-8698-2ca2ac5dfaba",
                                        "entry_id": "a4cb5613-9c40-37a6-9b63-20526a49a8fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of right and wrong action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9cfe409-39fe-44d6-8da4-6a297b09be00",
                                                "sense_id": "dfb8fb45-6b7f-3e38-8698-2ca2ac5dfaba",
                                                "text": "a moral agent"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cbde62c2-7aaf-3edc-934b-3599a5959f66",
                                        "entry_id": "a4cb5613-9c40-37a6-9b63-20526a49a8fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Probable but not proved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
